Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.45,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,The globe is but an empty paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is a paradise,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I will be able to save my hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.38,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,boku-ra no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.38,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Let's free it by ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be able to save my life.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.01,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.01,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Now put all your heart into running
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I will be able to save my life.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.01,0:00:48.27,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.01,0:00:48.27,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,through the steep endless road, far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.94,0:00:57.86,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,tachiagare! yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.94,0:00:57.86,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,I gotta stand up! There's a hero in me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.86,0:01:03.78,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.86,0:01:03.78,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,I'll never lose to such a towering target
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.78,0:01:09.83,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,moeagare! kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.78,0:01:09.83,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,I gotta flare up! The heartbeat in my chest
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.83,0:01:16.42,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.83,0:01:16.42,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,I'll take back our forgotten tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.42,0:01:22.14,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}atsui battle okose
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.42,0:01:22.14,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Starting a hot battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first day of school was wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I met this new kid, TK,\Nwho I think has a thing for Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then EZ shows up, and I find out\NTy's in trouble in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, and I got these\Nway cool new DigiVices,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only Kari and TK and I\Ngot to go through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe all those Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found the Digi-Egg of Courage, but\Nonly I was able to lift it, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I met V-Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which was good because he taught\Nme how to open the Digi-Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:02:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flamedermon is rad, but that evil Digimon\NEmperor looks like a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.55,0:02:10.01,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(270,0)\fscx150\fscy150\pos(317,326)\c&HFEF7FA&}Digital Gate, Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the computer room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, when you guys came through the\Ncomputer, where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place is the coolest ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we were, when suddenly a\Ndinosaur like Digimon attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's when I jumped into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we've had enough\Nexcitement for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go to\Nthe digital world, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, seeing all those\Nmonsters and stuff would be fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but tonight's macaroni and cheese night\Nat my house, and I don't want to miss out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pork surprise at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuffed green peppers in a salad,\NTV dinners in the microwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.46,0:02:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yoli,\Nyou'll get a chance Lynn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, I almost forgot\Nto turn off the computer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate's closed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're leaving already, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:03:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not done with rehearsal Sorry, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's something I gotta\Ntake care of Here he comes Hi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt Hey, everybody, sorry I'm late
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.\NIt's nice to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it's really like to\Nactually travel into the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if they don't want me along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I'm going to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, are you staying for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mac and cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.78,0:03:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I just can't stop\Nthinking about Veeamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a form of Digivolving\NI've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, Davis' Digimon was able to\NDigivolve, but Agumon and the others weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Davis from the soccer\Nclub went to the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and the two kids\Nfrom my apartment building,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli and Cody also got new Digivices.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:04:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if they have Digivices, that means\Nthat they are the new Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this Digimon Emperor is really hunting\NDigimon and making them his slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will Beaumont and the others be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got an email earlier\Nfrom Mimi in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was asking the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should just go there\Nand do things our way. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went back to check the computer\Nand the gate was already closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means we can't help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going back first thing\Ntomorrow morning and check
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the computer to see if the\Ngate has opened up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm going with you and so am i i
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't i've got an oral test tomorrow on
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,laryngitis yeah and my band's got a big\Nconcert coming up so we have to practice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't worry about it guys\Njust leave everything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to us okay but let us know if you need us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just as i thought it's still closed i've
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got to find a way to\Nthe digital world Izzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to get more information\Non what happened here yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, will you take me with\Nyou to the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't, because the gate's not... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the new digivices?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cool. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the ones that were released\Nfrom the digi-egg when I touched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we\Nstanding around here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i say let's get going hold it\Ni think i should give you a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,couple pointers about some of the\Nthings you're about to see give
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me a break you've only been there\Nonce what do you know i think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should be prepared for a\Nlittle danger my suspicions were
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,confirmed i just checked the\Nother computers none of them seems
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be affected by this the gate\Nis only open on this one here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's not all the gate has\Nnever been open two days in a row
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:06:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before then i say we get going All\Nthe shore that's going to shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai Kamiya, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen you in\Na while. Mr. Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Sora and Izzy are both here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you all graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the new head of the computer club.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what do you know\Nabout using computers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered, there's something I've\Nbeen meaning to talk to you about, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a minute? Sure. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been having problems\Nadjusting to high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so much older.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.99,0:06:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I feel like I just went through\Nthe rinse cycle of the dishwasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, I'm wearing different clothes,\Nand they're pretty comfortable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm dressed like I'm\Npart of the cool crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot the part about a new wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love this helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes my glasses look smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they have\Nanything in a surfer style.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till I tell my\Nsisters I got free clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kids today have no sense of values.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was a kid, I showed a lot more\Nrespect whenever I received a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, I hate to say this, but\Nyou're sounding just like my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon! Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let the games begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smeemon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.85,0:07:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke, come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prop Patamon and his friends with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon! Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, you're a sight for sore eyes, Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've missed you, Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've missed you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but without my tail\Nring, I don't have enough power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to armor Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, get the end ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill for a Mojimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mojimon lives deep inside the\Ncavities of the Digital World.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His drill-spin attack will make\Nyou wish you were at the dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up, Mojyamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mojimon's a frosty Digimon\Nfrom the snowy mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His bone boomerang attack\Nwill make your head spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, bone boomerang!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be-boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground just opened\Nup and swallowed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I want to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we have to protect ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm super sharp to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got V-Mon, but our Digimon\Nare only at half-strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, oh great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have been walking in my sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where, where am I? You're\Njust hanging out. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm your worst nightmare come\Nto life frankly i'm rather
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disappointed that i was able\Nto catch you so easily are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you the digimon emperor speaking\Nbut your kid just like me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm nothing like you\Nbecause if i were then i'd
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be the one hanging from a\Ncliff oh that reminds me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mon! Daisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:10:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had time to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, armor tissue ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, just one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna need these\Nto pull off that little trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This digivice you were nice enough\Nto give me is starting to make noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My digivice is going off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think something's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.98,0:11:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A building of some sort. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no buildings around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, just the temple. Temple?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's close down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They couldn't book enough\Nweddings or bar mitzvahs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, something in there is\Nmaking our digivices go off,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.20,0:11:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I don't think it's the caterers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hasn't anybody heard of escalators?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at it this way, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a few more steps to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like digi eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be what our digivices\Nhave been reacting to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, that one has the\Ncrest of love on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that one has the crest of knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never be able to move them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't budge the digi-egg\Nwith the crest of courage on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but somehow Davis moved\Nit with no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuli, I think you should try to move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, Cody. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they were able to lift them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like Davis did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels so good to be out from under\Nthat stuffy rock and spread my wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,howdy why'd you have to wake me\Nup i was having such a nice dream
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,greetings my name is Hawkmon\Nand i've been waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to make your acquaintance\Nuh you talking to me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well we i think michelle fell asleep hi\Ni'm Armadimon and you and i are partners
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, Yoli, you and I shall be\Nworking together as a team. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't fight except with my sister\Nover who gets the last cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you refuse to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harumph, why do I get stuck\Nwith a defective human? Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have this friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Mimi, and\Nshe's a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She used to tell me that she didn't\Nwant to fight anymore either,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though she knew she had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did it for the\Ndigital world, and for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll leave the more you do to help your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon. The closer the\Ntwo of you will become.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's a friendship you'll carry\Nwith you For the rest of your life
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.14,0:14:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you've got another\Nfriend for life, too Me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, what do you think of\Nthe digital world so far, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. After all, I've only\Nbeen here for a short time. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must have some sort of opinion
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I try not to make up my mind\Nuntil I have all the information,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this place is so new to me, I\Nhave so many unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't know\Nwhere to start first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem like a curious kid who\Njust wants to know all the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do just what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learn to trust your instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if there's a problem you\Ncan't solve, just come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you and I will solve it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in order for us to armor Digivolve,\Nyou must say Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Armor Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armour! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am an armored Digimon as Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use the Digi-Egg of\NLove to armor Digivolve
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use my Tempest Wing\NAttack to defeat my enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor Digivolve to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters\NDigimon, the drill of power
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I too am an armored\NDigimon As armored Tailmon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use the Digi-Egg of\Nknowledge to armor Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what do you say\Nwe go find the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me back my Digivice and let V-Mon go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've both been trespassing in\Nmy area without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as your punishment, you'll be forced\Nto watch V-Mon as he becomes my slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never get me to be your slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might as well destroy me\Nright now and get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, old buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know a good\Njoke when you hear one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, a little comedy\Nto lighten the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny guy, V-mon. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hear anyone laughing now, V-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, V-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.48,0:16:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to burst in on you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:16:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could've knocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This litter box ain't big\Nenough for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your claws to\Nyourself, you big bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scream on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mojyamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for a little payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say, V-Mon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:17:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blame Drummond, the fire of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's show them what Armor Digimon can\Ndo against the Slaves of the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it's fire against\Nice, fire always wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you destroyed the\Ndark ring, Fladramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for Tempest Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it, Possumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we're the drill team!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes things a lot more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only we had to fight you, but\Nwe had to get rid of the Dark Rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we're still buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being the Emperor's slave was the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.12,0:19:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All day long, it's destroy this,\Ndestroy that, get me a cappuccino, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.92,0:19:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He makes me so mad, Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show him who's in charge around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Settle down. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Yuli, will I be able to count\Non your assistance from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And will we be a team,\NCody, when I'm not napping?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'd be honored\Nto be your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like the new DigiDestined\Nteam doesn't need us around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still think we have a\Nlot of work ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still help them fight the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can also provide them\Nwith advice and guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:20:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me if I don't\Nstart checking in my boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The birds and the bees, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.57,0:20:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, when it comes to girls,\Nthis guy has a lot to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.22,0:20:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The new Digimon returned\Nto their entraining forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how\Nthis little fella can turn
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,himself into such a great\Nbig creature like Digmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna have to do this\Nevery time we come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought digivolving was a tough job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least we made it back\Nto the real world safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, except Biyomon and Tentomon. Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll both be safe here because the\NDigimon Emperor never comes out at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine all that power and\Nhe's afraid of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need it for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's when we'll go\Nback to the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and beat that Digimon\NEmperor once and for all.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.60,0:21:22.64,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.60,0:21:22.64,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a bit, everybody's completely different from yesterday
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.64,0:21:28.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,chotto mite mite yokogao no silhouette mo otona sa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.64,0:21:28.60,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Try to look and see for a bit! Even your face's silhouette looks matured
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.60,0:21:34.59,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,chotto kimi kimi iiwake o shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.60,0:21:34.59,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, wait! Your wanting to get an excuse is understandable
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.59,0:21:40.78,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.59,0:21:40.78,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,But if the world's like this, then nothing's ever gonna get done
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.78,0:21:46.65,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,da ne! kimochi ii kuuki o
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.78,0:21:46.65,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Right? I want to breathe...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.65,0:21:52.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ima! suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.65,0:21:52.60,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Now! ...a nice breeze! I can't help it, just can't help it!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.60,0:21:58.31,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.60,0:21:58.31,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow my wind will blow
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.31,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,sekaijuu no door akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.31,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,so leave the world's doors open
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.28,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.28,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow my wind will blow
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.28,0:22:19.12,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,kimi no sono yowamushi o mouretsu ni fukitobasu yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.28,0:22:19.12,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,so your cowardice will be blown away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be flying.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.72,0:22:29.05,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,gorgeous na jinsei o!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.72,0:22:29.05,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,in a gorgeous life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous love. My life is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The great Tyrannosaurus of the T-Rex The\Ngreat Tyrannosaurus of the T-Rex The great
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tyrannosaurus of the T-Rex\NThe great Tyrannosaurus
